    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nortown, a once vibrant community, now faces imminent demolition to make way for a bustling commercial hub. Its residents must now find new directions for their lives amidst this upheaval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/bcafafda54a89832b1b77b42c756e8d0.avif?t=1755185746\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Milly Sommerville, a detached tattoo artist who sets out to complete a forgotten wish from years ago, you will\u00a0explore Nortown and learn the past and present of its people through the remnants of the neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/26b762f834d26db61fb8506730ff2fa5.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/26b762f834d26db61fb8506730ff2fa5.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/26b762f834d26db61fb8506730ff2fa5.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/73be1688d3846b6dc9351970d3214cd4.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=744 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/73be1688d3846b6dc9351970d3214cd4.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/73be1688d3846b6dc9351970d3214cd4.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLOR REVELATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness your surrounding's true colors as you receive newfound impressions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/161780f6db12c615bdd4de2a91c33e21.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/161780f6db12c615bdd4de2a91c33e21.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/161780f6db12c615bdd4de2a91c33e21.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORIES OF LIFE TOLD THROUGH TATTOOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record stories through new tattoo designs based on your impressions of the neighborhood.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/8ef5ab0849874c172ca510f084f83fc7.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/8ef5ab0849874c172ca510f084f83fc7.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/8ef5ab0849874c172ca510f084f83fc7.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TATTOO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice your skills as a tattoo artist at<i> The Blindfolded</i>, give your clients their desired ink as you learn more about them through chit-chats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=698 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HERE, THEM, YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intersection of different lives, struggles, and decisions intertwining to tell the story of an everyday neighborhood.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/Characters.png?t=1755185746\" width=698 height=388 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/eb1316f475028db9d7f3bcb2f4781862.avif?t=1755185746\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
