s=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.poster.avif?t=1755185746\" width=698 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.webm?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/4f340b692d3a6f84e5309b7e42abc5ee.mp4?t=1755185746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HERE, THEM, YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intersection of different lives, struggles, and decisions intertwining to tell the story of an everyday neighborhood.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/Characters.png?t=1755185746\" width=698 height=388 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965930/extras/eb1316f475028db9d7f3bcb2f4781862.avif?t=1755185746\" data-has-big width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
